  "articleBody": "So, you're thinking about a home remodel or a construction project? That's exciting! When you bring on a general contractor like HH Remodeling, you're essentially partnering with someone who’s going to coordinate all the moving parts. We'll chat about your project goal, of course, and then dive into the nitty-gritty: your budget, who's making the big decisions, and how often we'll be checking in. Communication is key, and we make sure those channels are open from start to finish. We'll also iron out details like the projected start and completion dates, and how payment will work – sometimes it's upfront, sometimes by milestones, or even monthly, depending on what makes sense for your project. If you're dealing with multiple trades, permits, or a tight schedule, that's really when having a solid general contractor becomes super important. We handle all that coordination so you don't have to stress. Ready to make your house feel more like a home? Give us a call at 303-505-0866 to discuss your project!",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
